guide.Add("AllowedToAct|computers",new string[]{"Resource-based delegation is controlled by the target service computer descriptor; permission to edit it is distinct from a configured allowed principal.","Identify whether the edge records existing descriptor contents or a write capability, then validate source credentials, target protections and authentication prerequisites.","Remove unauthorized existing delegation or unnecessary descriptor writers at the actual target configuration or originating ACL.","Recollect both the descriptor and its writers, inspect alternative grants and test the approved service-authentication workflow.","Changing delegation can break applications that legitimately impersonate users to this service."});
