guide.Add("AllowedToDelegate|computers",new string[]{"The source account is configured for constrained delegation to a service associated with this computer.","Inspect the exact allowed SPNs, host resolution, protocol-transition setting, user sensitivity and current authentication conditions.","Remove obsolete service targets and restrict delegation to the exact approved service identities and destinations.","Recollect delegation and SPN resolution and test approved service authentication to each retained target.","A host-level graph edge abstracts specific services; not every service on that computer is necessarily authorized."});
